WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.050
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:06.320
You are not Bigfoot!

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:12.090
SCP-1000 is a nocturnal, omnivorous, highly
dangerous species of ape, colloquially known

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:13.769
as the cryptid Bigfoot.

00:00:13.769 --> 00:00:19.680
Dr. Bright does not share any qualities, aside
from being omnivorous, with SCP-1000.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.180
No matter what he says, he is not Bigfoot.

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:27.560
It doesn't matter how blurry he looks in photographs,
that's just because he won't sit still.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:32.180
While we're at it, he's not the Loch Ness
monster, either.

